Message?topicID=40.topic"> Next Topic >> </a> </td></tr></table> <table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=95%><tr><td bgcolor=#000000><table border=0 width=100% cellpadding=5 cellspacing=1><tr><td valign=top bgcolor=#636347 class=headings><font color=#fcfefd>Author</font></td><td valign=top bgcolor=#636347 class=headings><font color=#fcfefd>Comment</font></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Enarnage</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 12:35:16 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Lower Guk</span><hr size=1> Well, I've been thinking about doing a raid on LGuk for a while now.  I was thinking on a Tuesday, and was wondering who would be able to do it then.  This way, we'd have something in the middle of the week, on a day that's not too crowded, and also it's the day I'm most likely to be able to come.<br>
<br>
It would be very informal, no board sign up, and just make groups when we get there.  Also you would be free to bring friends.  Hopefully we could talk Zilb or Proc or someone like that to give us ports.<br>
<br>
I'd like input on what time of day to begin the raid.  I was thinking 5pm pacific or so would be good because that way those of you on the east coast wouldn't have to be up till 3am, and those of us on the west coast would be able to get home in time.<br>
<br>
I figure it would be pretty much go in, find some stuff to kill, and kill it.  I'd like to maybe hit the ass/sup room, where Serrated Bone Dirks, Mask of the Deceivers, Thick Banded Belts, and Light Burlap Sacks drop (according to my map anyway).  Of course, I'm a rogue, so this room looks extra good to me.  If we had a second group, maybe they could try a harder area.  If we found a corner with decent loot we could maybe stick a group of many of our lower level players in the corner, with the higher group sort of outside to protect them.  Then the higher group could keep the area clear so the lower ones wouldn't take a huge train, and the higher group could pull from all over.  Just a thought.  Just by looking at the map, doing something like this looks like it would be easiest either where the frenzied ghoul spawns, where the sentinel spawns, the ass/sup room (although there's a second floor nearby, the monsters didn't run down there when I was there today), the archmagi room, the reanimated hand room... there's lots of spots.  <br>
<br>
Anyway, I guess I better shut up about now.  Basically, depending on the turnout and how brave we feel, there are several spots we could try.  As a meeting spot, I would like to do it in LOWER guk, at the zone, as opposed to upper guk.  Mainly, it's because I'm aggro in Upper Guk and don't want to have to get out.  Which is the second reason I want to do a raid down here--to get a ride out.  But really, fun zone, great loot, and you don't have to run very far at all to find some more stuff to pull.  In a group I was in earlier today, we probably pulled stuff from over 15 spawns.  Oh yeah, the monsters are fairly easy.  At one point we took 6 things that I think all conned blue to me, and I was one of the highest in the group.  And we did without an enchanter.  Maybe it's just the easier parts of the dungeon where you can do this though, not sure.  That's about all the info I have on the place.  Maybe check out an item list and see what looks good to you, then a bestiary (eqcasters is nice because it shows the max melee damage a lot of the monsters do, along with their class).  I guess I didn't really shut up like I said I would about 3 pages ago.  Anyway, just tell me if you'd be interested on a Tuesday, say when the best time for you would be.. and don't forget to state your time zone.  Bring friends.  Would be pretty neat if we got well over 12 people because we brought friends.  The more we have, the safer we'll be.  Ok, ok.  I'm done.<br>
<br>
E <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 5:35:39 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=1>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> guk</span><hr size=1> I assume this is the dead side? And sounds great to me, couple times tried to get stuff going in there and been talking about needing to go back.  Yes, guk has some really great drops.  Count me in.  I'm good on Tuesdays at 5pac (7pm cent for me) so I'll plan on being there.  <br>
<br>
*Tressia<br>
 <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ubelnorsilverheart.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Belnor Silverheart</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 5:47:11 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: guk</span><hr size=1> I'll come also. <br>
<br>
Belnor Silverheart<br>
Cleric of Tunare <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Enarnage</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 7:55:13 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Ok</span><hr size=1> Ok, just remember I don't have an exact date set yet.  Still trying to decide when it's be best for me and others.  I was reading a bit about the zone last night, and it sounded like a good mid 40's-50 group could actually take the lord, hand, and archmagi rooms.  Maybe if we had 2 groups we could take those rooms and some other stuff.  Also, of course, we'd have to hope that most stuff isn't camped.  Supposedly frenzied and archmagi are camped a bunch.  Which I definitely believe.  And yeah, it would be the dead side that we'd be on.  For one thing, I'd also like to get faction with the living ones up.  If we can get a few more to sign up here, I'll set a date.<br>
<br>
E <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/bgoldenlegion.showLocalUserPublicProfile?login=jaqal>Jaqal</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 8:28:21 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Lower Guk</span><hr size=1> I'll come along.  Still need an SMR.  For myself and for my epic quest.  Hehe. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Enarnage</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/2/01 10:13:25 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=5>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> yay</span><hr size=1> Alright, now that we've got an enchanter and a cleric, we should be fine.. so it'll probably be next Tuesday, the 8th, at 5pm pacific.. so I guess just plan on being there for now, and I'll try and post something for sure by Sunday.  Not quite sure what next week's plans will be for me yet.  As far as leaving the area, we'll just decide as a group I think.  Just try and at least stay for a few hours!<br>
<br>
E <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umytic006.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Mytic006</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/3/01 10:25:44 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=6>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> LGuk</span><hr size=1> sure, i would love to come...just one bad thing is..heh, im gonna brag here...<br>
<br>
im the #1 ranked runner in the 100m dash in western pennsylvania...and the next to track meets that i have to run in are on tuesday's...so tuesday's would be REALLY bad for me cause i prolly wouldn't get home til about 10 or so...and i would really really enjoy a raid like that...<br>
<br>
so i was thinking, why don't we do it like all night on a friday or something...like take over teh whole zone around 9pm est. and camp all the good stuff...<br>
<br>
Anyone in the guild can get in the ass/sup group...the rest of the higher leveled guild members can just split up the other good camps...and then we can pull whatever from wherever...<br>
<br>
but yeah, i think that would be awesome, i could use an FBSS or TBB...<br>
<br>
Erratic Blade<br>
now 35...should be 36 this weekend  <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START 8) --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/glasses.gif ALT="8)"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> <br>
<br>
p.s. how did the TOFS raid go last night? (may 2nd) <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umytic006.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Mytic006</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/3/01 10:27:17 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=7>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> btw...</span><hr size=1> im sure Zrax would be able to come whenever...he's a 36 cleric now...<br>
<br>
Erratic Blade <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Enarnage</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/3/01 2:12:05 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=8>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Eh.. we could</span><hr size=1> We could do that, Erratic, although I think I'd like to first do it on a Tuesday, since that's the day I'm least likely to be doing something.  But if it goes well we'll probably head down there again, since there is some damn nice stuff in lguk.  Also, good job on the running.<br>
<br>
E <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Enarnage</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/6/01 1:52:59 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=9>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> yep</span><hr size=1> Yep, gonna do the raid on Tuesday the 8th, 5pm pacific.  So show up!  I'll do my best to remember, too!  I'm sure we can find someone in our guild that can get people through uguk if needed.  I'm KoS there, so it probably won't be me!  And, you know, if I forget the raid, the rest of you will be there and can run around killing stuff!  As I said, there's not going to be a whole lot of organization, but we should do just fine if we get even just 1 decent group together.<br>
<br>
E <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tyho </span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(5/7/01 1:39:32 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=10>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> LGuk</span><hr size=1> Count me in.....hehe im ok with the froggies in UGuk, have never killed a one be there at 5PM pst ! <p></p><i></i></td></tr></table> </td></tr></table> <table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><a href="http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showPrevMessage?topicID=40.topic"> << Prev Topic</a>&nbsp;| <a href="http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showNextMessage?topicID=40.topic"> Next Topic >> </a><br><br><a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=40.topic&index=10><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/addReply.jpg border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.emailToFriend?topicID=40.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.threadControl?topicID=40.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/deleteThread.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=40.topic>Subscribe</a> Click to receive email notification of replies<br>  <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.unsubscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=40.topic>Unsubscribe</a> Click to stop receiving email notification of replies<br> </td><td align="right" v